## Keystores decoded into the tree by CI (deploy-android.yml: the REAL
## release key; android.yml: the shared debug key from
## DEBUG_KEYSTORE_BASE64). Key material must never be committed — a
## keystore in a public repo is signing capability for the world, and a
## committed debug keystore was reviewed OUT for exactly that (2026-08-30,
## PLAYQUALITY.md "shared debug keystore").
android/release.jks
android/debug.keystore
