# tsc output. web/main.js predates the TypeScript conversion — it was
# hand-written JS, main.ts arrived later, and tsc emits over the same path,
# so the file stayed tracked by accident rather than intent. Nothing reads
# the committed copy: the Makefile and both web workflows run tsc before
# the copy into web/dist/play, and Pages publishes web/dist. Tracking it
# only let it drift from the source, which it did.
web/main.js
board/.wrangler*/
signal/.wrangler*/
.wrangler*/

# Screenshot harness output (shots/run.sh); approved renders are force-added
shots/out/
